Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 00:31:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] Adopt upstream PR #58094: propagate rope hf_overrides to
 MTP draft

Covers our --hf-overrides YaRN path (nested text_config.rope_parameters
and max_position_embeddings forwarded, applied before arch mapping).
Replaces our local patch 7; its wrapper-mirror leg was already dead at
this base. Difference vs our version: forwards rope-keyed subsets for
any draft, not full dicts for same-checkpoint drafts only.

Fixed from the PR as merged here: the annotations said PretrainedConfig
(HF spelling), which this tree never imports; speculative.py raised
NameError at import. Renamed to PreTrainedConfig.

Upstream-PR: vllm-project/vllm#58094 (gokay-ai, pending)
